{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put a horde of Spooklings to work gathering bones, brimstone and slug shampoo in this macabre night-time land! Build an eerie graveyard town for Wilhelm the grave keeper, Count Kefula, and the other spooky Kefling residents of this chilling world. Horrifying creations await you as you create your creepy kingdom and work out how to deal with the largest, most horrifying creation of all... the Zombiesaurus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessing the DLC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC is a new standalone story inside A World of Keflings. Choose Play Game -&gt; New Game from the main menu and select the DLC story to start the new experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3302330?t=1759448686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302330/d38015f673806d26eb7d8e22a3dac6b1b5fd66ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759448686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302330/22ff9a27ab394783add048b767e377c822d53358/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759448686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3302330/22ff9a27ab394783add048b767e377c822d53358/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759448686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"F